2026\-08\-30  NOT run, and deliberately so: the CUTOVER. It is a production
            change to a shared host and needs Zach's go, not an agent's.

DIVERGED, recorded 2026\-08\-30 09:50Z by etat.sh:
  long_readout 4 \-> 5 and soft_lockup 1 \-> 2 WHILE THIS WAS BEING WRITTEN.
  The series this boot, clocksource stall and the matching CPU lockup:

    02:52:36    1.85 s
    02:56:29    4.39 s
