    05:24:24   41.57 s   soft lockup: CPU#0 stuck for 42s  [swapper/0:0]
    09:42:09  415.67 s   soft lockup: CPU#0 stuck for 390s [swapper/0:0]

  Read the 390 s, not the 415 s. The stall is what the clock noticed; 390 s is
