.SS And what a WRONG target produces, so it is recognisable
Pointed at a distro that is not monkey, the witness refuses rather than passes.
This is real output, from `\-\-target wsl:Ubuntu' against monkey's baseline:
.nf

  MOVED  machine_id       25cb8cab... \-> 1f1ba15d...
  MOVED  hostname         monkey \-> dexter
  MOVED  accounts         18 \-> 0
